WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.049
Kip walked along the sidewalk.

2
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:09.267
"Goose is Bird's friend," he said.

3
00:00:09.268 --> 00:00:12.143
"She's not my friend.

4
00:00:12.144 --> 00:00:20.983
She's too big and too loud."

5
00:00:20.984 --> 00:00:29.249
Just then Kip saw something.

6
00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:34.206
A cat was sitting on a window ledge.

7
00:00:34.207 --> 00:00:37.612
"Meow!" said the cat.

8
00:00:37.613 --> 00:00:42.903
"Oh no!" cried Kip.

9
00:00:42.904 --> 00:00:45.052
Kip started to run.

10
00:00:45.053 --> 00:00:47.891
The cat jumped after him.

11
00:00:47.892 --> 00:00:51.775
Kip ran as fast as he could.

12
00:00:51.776 --> 00:00:58.496
So did the cat.

13
00:00:58.497 --> 00:01:07.597
"Ah!" cried Kip.

14
00:01:07.598 --> 00:01:13.176
Suddenly Bird and Goose flew over to Kip.

15
00:01:13.177 --> 00:01:18.445
"There you are!" said Bird.

16
00:01:18.446 --> 00:01:20.702
Goose landed in front of the cat.

17
00:01:20.703 --> 00:01:24.457
"Honk! Honk! Honk!" cried Goose.

18
00:01:24.458 --> 00:01:27.146
The cat got scared and ran away.

19
00:01:27.147 --> 00:01:31.628
"You saved me, Goose!" said Kip.

20
00:01:31.629 --> 00:01:34.196
"Thank you!"

21
00:01:34.197 --> 00:01:38.563
"Honk! You're Bird's friend," said Goose.

22
00:01:38.564 --> 00:01:43.074
"So you're my friend too."

23
00:01:43.075 --> 00:01:51.579
Kip was happy to have two good friends.

24
00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:55.344
"I like Goose," he thought.

25
00:01:55.345 --> 00:02:01.974
"It's good to have a big, loud friend!"

